WEBVTT

1
00:01:24.268 --> 00:01:25.009
song Pink has a phone.

2
00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:27.731
The phone is white.

3
00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:31.714
Beep! Beep!

4
00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:36.638
Pink: Phil is at the sea.

5
00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.341
He is with Ralph.

6
00:01:44.383 --> 00:01:46.085
They see a whale.

7
00:01:47.226 --> 00:01:49.467
Blue: Let's go to the sea!

8
00:01:56.756 --> 00:01:58.297
The pals get in a van.

9
00:01:59.999 --> 00:02:01.280
Pink grabs the wheel.

10
00:02:04.503 --> 00:02:05.984
They drive past wheat.

11
00:02:08.866 --> 00:02:10.067
They come to the sea.

12
00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:14.971
They meet Phil and Ralph.

13
00:02:29.736 --> 00:02:31.377
Red: I see the whale!

14
00:02:35.679 --> 00:02:39.380
Splash! The whale makes a big wave.

15
00:02:43.502 --> 00:02:43.883
Oh no!

16
00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:45.683
The pals are in the sea.

17
00:02:47.264 --> 00:02:51.686
Yellow：Help! Help!

18
00:02:51.766 --> 00:02:55.308
Green： Here come white dolphins.

19
00:02:58.604 --> 00:03:00.065
The dolphins save them.

20
00:03:08.548 --> 00:03:09.268
Thank you!
